exports[`dsh terminal journey snapshots > /help lists the live command registry as text 1`] = `
"/compact — Compact older conversation history
/exit — Leave the terminal session
/feedback <text> — record feedback about this session
/goal [<objective>|clear|edit <objective>|pause|resume] — set or view the goal for a long-running
task
/help — List the commands this terminal resolves
/model [provider/model] — Show or switch the model this session uses



















